---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../data/url';
---
<Base title="Disclaimer & Affiliate Disclosure" description="AI Tools Optimizer disclaimer and affiliate disclosure: how the site earns money from ads and affiliate links, accuracy of pricing information, and no professional advice.">
  <section class="container section prose">
    <span class="pill">// legal</span><h1>Disclaimer &amp; <span class="grad">Affiliate Disclosure</span></h1>
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> October 16, 2026</p>
    <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
    <p>Some links on AI Tools Optimizer, including "Visit [tool]" buttons, may be affiliate links. If you click one and then buy or subscribe, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Affiliate links are marked with <code>rel="sponsored"</code> for search engines.</p>
    <p>Affiliate relationships do not decide which tools are listed or how they are described. Many tools in the directory have no affiliate program, and we list them anyway. We are not paid by any company to be included in the directory.</p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>The site shows ads served by Google AdSense. Ads are chosen automatically by Google and its partners. We do not endorse the products or services advertised. See our <a href={url('/privacy/')}>Privacy Policy</a> and <a href={url('/cookies/')}>Cookie Policy</a> for how advertising cookies work and how to opt out.</p>
    <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
    <p>Prices are shown in US dollars and, along with plans and features, are taken from official sources on the date shown on each page. AI tools change quickly: prices, limits, availability and features may have changed since then, and prices may differ by country, taxes and billing period. Always confirm details on the provider's official website before you buy. If you spot an error, please email <a href="mailto:contact@aitoolsoptimizer.com">contact@aitoolsoptimizer.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>No professional advice</h2>
    <p>Content on this site is for general information and education only. It is not legal, financial, tax, medical or other professional advice. Output from AI tools can be inaccurate. Check important results yourself.</p>
    <h2>Trademarks and independence</h2>
    <p>All product names, logos and brands are the property of their respective owners. AI Tools Optimizer is independent and is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by any company listed, unless explicitly stated.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this disclosure? Email <a href="mailto:contact@aitoolsoptimizer.com">contact@aitoolsoptimizer.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
